# I would upgrade the foundation to this

### Rig v2

Instead of fixed 2D coordinates:

```json
{
  "joint": "hand.R",
  "position": [340, 390]
}
```

use normalized skeleton semantics:

```json
{
  "joint": "hand.R",
  "parent": "lowerArm.R",
  "rest_rotation": [0, 0, 0, 1],
  "constraints": {
    "rotation": "human_arm"
  }
}
```

Add:

```text
rest pose
local rotations
bone hierarchy
joint limits
IK targets
look-at target
foot contacts
hand contacts
dominant hand
body scale
coordinate convention
```

