# Implements also need 3D contracts

A dagger becomes:

```json
{
  "id": "dagger.standard.v1",

  "anchors": {
    "grip": {
      "position": [0,0,0],
      "rotation": [0,0,0,1]
    },

    "tip": {
      "position": [0,0,0.32]
    }
  }
}
```

Now GRIM can say:

```text
attach dagger.grip → hand.R
```

and:

```text
move dagger.tip along pentagram.path
```

Same logic works in 2D and 3D.

