## My peer-review verdict

**Keep the entire Witness → GRIM → Scene → Score architecture.**

Change the current rig layer before producing lots more corpus.

Specifically:

**`operator.human.v1` should become a compatibility fixture.**

Build:

```text
rig.contract.v2
rig.humanoid.v2
rig.creature.v1

avatar.thoth.2d
avatar.thoth.3d

adapter.vrm
adapter.meshy
adapter.mixamo
renderer.threejs
```

Then make **Thoth v1** our first canonical cross-renderer character:

```text
